msgstr "WHAM の pH Weight で性質を計算する。"

#: README.md:17
msgid "Software Installation"
msgstr "ソフトウェアのインストール"

#: README.md:19
msgid ""
"We will need PLUMED 2.9.0, a GROMACS version 2023 patched with PLUMED and "
"the CpHMD v3.0 for this tutorial. The first two softwares can be installed "
"using the instructions found "
"[here](https://github.com/plumed/cecam2023/blob/main/software.md). For the "
"installation of the CpHMD v3.0, we recommend visiting the [GitHub "
"page](https://github.com/NunoFBOliveira/CpHMD_v3/tree/main) of the CpHMD "
"method by the Machuqueiro group and installing the AMBER version. Following "
"that installation, visit the [CpH-Metadynamics "
"page](https://github.com/Tomfersil/CpH-MetaD/tree/main) by Tomás F. D. Silva"
" and follow the instructions on how to patch the CpHMD v3.0 for modified "
"AMBER $\\chi$ OL3 RNA parameters and the metadynamics compatibility using "
"PLUMED. Please follow nad cite the relevant papers mentioned in the GitHub "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"PLUMED 2.9.0、PLUMED で Patch した GROMACS 2023、CpHMD v3.0 が必要です。最初の2つは "
"[こちら](https://github.com/plumed/cecam2023/blob/main/software.md) "
"の手順を使えます。CpHMD v3.0 は Machuqueiro Group の "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/NunoFBOliveira/CpHMD_v3/tree/main) で AMBER "
"版をインストールしてください。次に Tomás F. D. Silva の [CpH-"
"Metadynamics](https://github.com/Tomfersil/CpH-MetaD/tree/main) で、修正版 AMBER "
"$\\chi$ OL3 RNA パラメータと PLUMED Metadynamics 対応の Patch 手順に従います。各 GitHub "
"の関連論文を読み、引用してください。"

